></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353420/extras/0349ed4ae0c4c5d2b477a79ebae2f17c.avif?t=1750747711\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>One conversation mechanic that simultaneously supports romantic interactions and thrilling deductions!<br></li><li>Uniquely generated plotlines and a scoring system add replay value.<br></li><li>Play the way that you want:<br>      Be romantic and find your one-true-love.<br>      Focus only on the investigation if you don't care to flirt.<br>      Marry all of your suitors (maybe avoid bad actors).</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353420/extras/c3e4c5e96019c1ce1890d90b96d1a220.avif?t=1750747711\" /></span>",
